          "type": "sidebox",
          "title": "Pinning Is Dead",
          "items": [
            "HPKP is deprecated and removed from browsers",
            "A wrong pin bricked domains with no recovery path",
            "Use CAA records plus CT monitoring instead",
            "HSTS max-age kills the SSL-strip downgrade window"
